# BuildKit-specific ignore file for manifests/installation/compose/Dockerfile.
#
# The build context is the repository root. Without this file the context would
# include _output (several GB) and the root-level build artefacts. The root
# .dockerignore deliberately keeps _output because Dockerfile.runtime-only
# copies from it; this file only affects the compose build.

_output
mcpctl
pg2crd
oai-scheduledrun-migrator

.git
.github
docs
manifests
examples
tmp
temp
test-results
*.md
